  "frontier_coordinate": "R-142 compresses the complete mixed-endpoint current/residual signature exactly from (U,J,R) to the actual two-feature owner (U,Phi), pins the fixed-chart trace feature with a shared covariance-square-root probe, and retains the favorable R-102 product covariance in the full feature Hessian. The coefficient-exact SU(2) fibre block has four active modes and two phase kernels. The registered A1 family-lock covariance splits into a scalar principal sea plus a positive anisotropic derivative covariance four high-frequency powers smoother. A legal scalar two-root/two-visit chart is uniformly positive, while the exact moved C8/C10 rational scalar-slice bands contain finite-cutoff negative directions. The decisive successor is the non-Toeplitz q=5,6,7 four-channel U/Phi cross-reveal matrix with anisotropic and returned-low blocks. A uniform signed upper Loewner bound, complete source-null/low compatibility, a positive graph gap, matching, absolute anchor, both A13 gates, OVERLAP_src, Nelson, removals, interacting measure, and Sector A remain open.",
